    {
     "title": "习惯、事实、时刻表",
     "points": [
      "用法：经常做的事（I walk to work）、客观事实（Water boils at 100°C）、时刻表（The train leaves at 8）。",
      "第三人称单数加 -s：plays, works；加 -es：goes, does, watches；辅音 + y 变 ies：study → studies；have → has。",
      "常见时间词：always, usually, often, sometimes, never, every day, on Mondays。",
      "频率副词位置：放在实义动词前、be 动词后：She often eats out. / He is always late."
     ],
     "examples": [
      [
       "My father usually goes to work at eight.",
       "我爸爸通常八点去上班。"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
