   "grammar": [
    {
     "ref": "b_prog"
    },
    {
     "title": "此刻正在做",
     "points": [
      "结构：am / is / are + 动词 -ing：I'm reading. They are playing.",
      "-ing 变法：一般直接加（work → working）；去不发音的 e（make → making）；重读闭音节双写末尾辅音（run → running, sit → sitting）；ie → ying（lie → lying）。",
      "时间词：now, right now, at the moment, Look! Listen!",
      "也表示近期临时状态：I'm living with my parents this month.",
      "状态动词一般不用进行时：know, like, want, need, believe, own。"
     ],
     "examples": [
      [
       "Look! It's raining.",
       "看！下雨了。"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
   "special": [
    {
     "w": "at the moment",
     "t": "固定搭配",
     "s": [
      [
       "",
       "此刻"
      ]
